WEBVTT

00:03:29.038 --> 00:03:31.621
there just is no courage
without vulnerability.

00:03:32.371 --> 00:03:37.621
I tell the story of asking a group of
soldiers a very simple question.

00:03:37.871 --> 00:03:42.038
Give me an example of courage
in your life or

00:03:42.413 --> 00:03:46.079
an example of courage that you've observed
in someone else that did not

00:03:46.079 --> 00:03:49.746
require uncertainty, risk
or emotional exposure.

00:03:50.496 --> 00:03:54.746
And I think I was at Fort Bragg and there
was just absolute silence until

00:03:54.746 --> 00:03:57.538
one guy stood up and said,
three tours, ma'am,

00:03:57.996 --> 00:04:00.996
there is no courage without vulnerability.